         CLC   IOBRADD(2),IOINTPRM+2 IS THIS FOR US?           XA0012DK         
./ R 00304420          $ 00304425 005                                           
         CLC   IOBRADD(2),IOINTPRM+2 IS THIS ONE FOR US?       XA0012DK         
./ R 00324000          $ 00324100 100                                           
