         DS    0H             THE LCTL IS GONE                 XA0012DK         
./ R 00369000          $ 00369010 010                                           
*  WAS LCTL C2,C2,TEMPSAVE -- AND RESTORE IT.                  XA0012DK         
         DS    0H             THE LCTL IS GONE                 XA0012DK         
./ R 00410100          $ 00410110 010                                           
         CLC   IOINTPRM+2(2),IOBRADD                           XA0012DK         
